  "worked_solution": "The center of the circle is located at the midpoint of the diameter. Therefore, we can calculate it using the midpoint formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(h,k) & =(\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2},\\frac{{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{5-1}{2},\\frac{3-3}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{4}{2},\\frac{0}{2}) \\\\  & =(2,0).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
